{"availability":"available","full":"bkraad47/ramen-demo-mcp-group","name":"ramen-demo-mcp-group","description":"Demo MCP group repo for Ramen, the self-hosted multi-zone MCP server: one tool, one resource, one prompt and an env.yaml. Point a Ramen group at it and press Deploy.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-27T09:30:47Z","updated":"2026-10-11T12:48:48Z","license":"BSD-3-Clause","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bkraad47.github.io/ramen/get-started/","topics":["example","mcp","mcp-server","mcp-tools","model-context-protocol","python","ramen"],"demo":"https://bkraad47.github.io/ramen/get-started/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:59:22.099Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:59:22.099Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:59:22.099Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:25:29.231Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:12:33.367Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:59:22.099Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A ready-to-connect group repo for Ramen. Point a Ramen group at this repo, click Deploy, and you get one tool, one resource and one prompt.","Every tool proto declares output; Ramen 0.7.0 publishes it as the MCP outputSchema and the worker validates the result against it. Descriptions say what the tool returns, what fails and when to use it, which is what tool-quality scorers (Glama's TDQS) and models read.","mcp/tests.yaml holds golden cases: the console runs them against the canary before the stable workers take the new code, and a failing case aborts the deploy (Ramen 0.7.0). VERSION names the Ramen release this repo was last verified with; the repo is tagged with the same v."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bkraad47/ramen-demo-mcp-group/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"62a6824f5addf7a61ac8a869bdbfe15bd927a0c8c210f4aad19cfcacf7aacc54","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:29.383Z"},"overvi